config.customPrices.description:
Custom or additional per-model prices, in **USD per 1M tokens**. Every field is optional and merges field-wise over the built-in table, so you can correct a single rate.

```json
"tokenPace.customPrices": {
  "gpt-5.6-sol": {
    "input": 4, "output": 20,
    "cacheRead": 0.4, "cacheWrite5m": 0, "cacheWrite1h": 0
  },
  "claude-opus-5": { "fast": { "input": 30, "output": 150 } }
}
```

As soon as one override applies, the figures are labelled “at your configured rates”. Non-numeric or negative values are ignored, not guessed.
